strong data-start=3D"1408" data-end=3D"1420">services</strong>, des <strong=
 data-start=3D"1426" data-end=3D"1440">composants</strong>, ou des <strong =
data-start=3D"1449" data-end=3D"1456">API</strong> qui manipulent des donn=
=C3=A9es de mani=C3=A8re dynamique.</p>
