<h2 data-start=3D"1402" data-end=3D"1457" class=3D"">1. Introduction =C3=A0=
 la Liaison de Donn=C3=A9es dans Angular</h2>
<p data-start=3D"1459" data-end=3D"1752" class=3D"">La <strong data-start=
=3D"1462" data-end=3D"1484">liaison de donn=C3=A9es</strong> (data binding)=
 dans Angular permet de synchroniser les donn=C3=A9es entre un <strong data=
-start=3D"1557" data-end=3D"1570">composant</strong> (qui contient la logiq=
ue) et son <strong data-start=3D"1604" data-end=3D"1616">template</strong> =
(qui contient l'interface utilisateur). Cela rend l'interaction entre l'uti=
lisateur et l'application beaucoup plus fluide et dynamique.</p>
<p data-start=3D"1754" data-end=3D"1919" class=3D"">Angular offre plusieurs=
 m=C3=A9canismes de liaison de donn=C3=A9es, chacun adapt=C3=A9 =C3=A0 un t=
ype sp=C3=A9cifique de communication entre le mod=C3=A8le (le composant) et=
 la vue (le template).</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"1921" data-end=3D"1965" class=3D"">Types de Liaison de Do=
nn=C3=A9es dans Angular</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"1967" data-end=3D"2170">
<li data-start=3D"1967" data-end=3D"2056" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1969" data-end=3D"2056" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
969" data-end=3D"1998">Liaison unidirectionnelle</strong> : La donn=C3=A9e =
va d'un composant vers la vue ou inversement.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2057" data-end=3D"2170" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2059" data-end=3D"2170" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
059" data-end=3D"2087">Liaison bidirectionnelle</strong> : La donn=C3=A9e s=
e synchronise =C3=A0 la fois dans les deux sens entre le mod=C3=A8le et la =
vue.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"2172" data-end=3D"2216" class=3D"">La syntaxe pour chaque=
 type de liaison :</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"2217" data-end=3D"2373">
<li data-start=3D"2217" data-end=3D"2257" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2219" data-end=3D"2257" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
219" data-end=3D"2236">Interpolation</strong> : <code data-start=3D"2239" d=
ata-end=3D"2257">{{ expression }}</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2258" data-end=3D"2292" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2260" data-end=3D"2292" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
260" data-end=3D"2285">Liaison de propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s</strong> : <code dat=
a-start=3D"2288" data-end=3D"2292">[]</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2293" data-end=3D"2326" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2295" data-end=3D"2326" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
295" data-end=3D"2319">Liaison d'=C3=A9v=C3=A9nements</strong> : <code data=
-start=3D"2322" data-end=3D"2326">()</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2327" data-end=3D"2373" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2329" data-end=3D"2373" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
329" data-end=3D"2357">Liaison bidirectionnelle</strong> : <code data-start=
=3D"2360" data-end=3D"2373">[(ngModel)]</code></p>
