n</h2>
<p data-start=3D"7264" data-end=3D"7503" class=3D"">Le <strong data-start=
=3D"7267" data-end=3D"7294">binding unidirectionnel</strong> est une <stron=
g data-start=3D"7303" data-end=3D"7346">cl=C3=A9 de vo=C3=BBte de la r=C3=
=A9activit=C3=A9 d'Angular</strong>. En utilisant intelligemment <strong da=
ta-start=3D"7376" data-end=3D"7395">l=E2=80=99interpolation</strong> et le =
<strong data-start=3D"7402" data-end=3D"7422">property binding</strong>, vo=
us pouvez construire des interfaces dynamiques, performantes et maintenable=
s.</p>
<p data-start=3D"7505" data-end=3D"7674" class=3D"">C=E2=80=99est la base i=
ndispensable avant d=E2=80=99explorer le <strong data-start=3D"7553" data-e=
nd=3D"7572">two-way binding</strong> (<code data-start=3D"7574" data-end=3D=
"7587">[(ngModel)]</code>), les <strong data-start=3D"7594" data-end=3D"761=
2">event bindings</strong> (<code data-start=3D"7614" data-end=3D"7623">(cl=
ick)</code>), ou encore la <strong data-start=3D"7639" data-end=3D"7673">co=
mmunication entre composants</strong>.</p>
<p data-start=3D"7676" data-end=3D"7788" class=3D"">Souhaitez-vous maintena=
nt un tutoriel avanc=C3=A9 sur le <strong data-start=3D"7728" data-end=3D"7=
747">two-way binding</strong> ou les <strong data-start=3D"7755" data-end=
=3D"7773">event bindings</strong> dans Angular ?</p></div></div></div><div =
data-message-author-role=3D"assistant" data-message-id=3D"5faec4fb-a621-45a=
4-b770-22222d1cc358" dir=3D"auto" class=3D"min-h-8 text-message relative fl=
ex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal=
 [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5" data-message-model-slug=3D"gpt-4o"><div class=
=3D"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]"><div class=3D"m=
arkdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words light"><p data-start=3D"=
0" data-end=3D"311" class=3D"">Voici un <strong data-start=3D"9" data-end=
=3D"119">tutoriel complet et approfondi sur le binding bidirectionnel (two-=
way binding) avec <code data-start=3D"95" data-end=3D"104">ngModel</code> d=
ans Angular</strong>, destin=C3=A9 aux d=C3=A9veloppeurs allant du niveau d=
=C3=A9butant jusqu=E2=80=99=C3=A0 un niveau avanc=C3=A9/professionnel. Ce t=
utoriel fait partie du module <em data-start=3D"246" data-end=3D"280">Templ=
ates, Directives et Binding</em> dans les Fondations d'Angular.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"313" data-end=3D"316" class=3D"">
<h1 data-start=3D"318" data-end=3D"372" class=3D"">=F0=9F=94=81 Angular - B=
inding bidirectionnel avec <code data-start=3D"361" data-end=3D"370">ngMode=
l</code></h1>
<h2 data-start=3D"373" data-end=3D"458" class=3D"">(Fondations Angular : Te=
mplates, Directives et Binding =E2=80=93 Niveau D=C3=A9butant =C3=A0 Expert=
)</h2>
<hr data-start=3D"460" data-end=3D"463" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"465" data-end=3D"492" class=3D"">=F0=9F=8E=AF Objectifs d=
u tutoriel</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"494" data-end=3D"910">
<li data-start=3D"494" data-end=3D"560" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"496" data-end=3D"560" class=3D"">Comprendre ce qu=E2=80=99=
est le <strong data-start=3D"520" data-end=3D"546">binding bidirectionnel</=
strong> dans Angular.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"561" data-end=3D"666" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"563" data-end=3D"666" class=3D"">Apprendre =C3=A0 utiliser=
 <strong data-start=3D"584" data-end=3D"601"><code data-start=3D"586" data-=
end=3D"599">[(ngModel)]</code></strong> pour synchroniser les donn=C3=A9es =
entre le composant et le template.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"667" data-end=3D"733" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"669" data-end=3D"733" class=3D"">Conna=C3=AEtre les <stron=
g data-start=3D"683" data-end=3D"698">cas d=E2=80=99usage</strong>, les <st=
rong data-start=3D"704" data-end=3D"717">avantages</strong> et <strong data=
-start=3D"721" data-end=3D"732">limites</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"734" data-end=3D"817" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"736" data-end=3D"817" class=3D"">Comprendre le fonctionnem=
ent sous-jacent : <strong data-start=3D"779" data-end=3D"811">syntaxe sucr=
=C3=A9e, forms module</strong>, etc.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"818" data-end=3D"910" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"820" data-end=3D"910" class=3D"">Approfondir avec des sc=
=C3=A9narios avanc=C3=A9s, validation, et gestion des formulaires dynamique=
s.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"912" data-end=3D"915" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"917" data-end=3D"967" class=3D"">=F0=9F=A7=A0 1. Qu=E2=80=
=99est-ce que le Binding Bidirectionnel ?</h2>
<p data-start=3D"969" data-end=3D"1119" class=3D"">Le <strong data-start=3D=
"972" data-end=3D"998">binding bidirectionnel</strong> permet de <strong da=
ta-start=3D"1009" data-end=3D"1046">lier une propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9 d=E2=80=99=
un composant</strong> =C3=A0 un <strong data-start=3D"1052" data-end=3D"107=
0">=C3=A9l=C3=A9ment du DOM</strong> (souvent un champ de formulaire), de s=
orte que :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1121" data-end=3D"1308">
<li data-start=3D"1121" data-end=3D"1191" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1123" data-end=3D"1191" class=3D"">Si la <strong data-star=
t=3D"1129" data-end=3D"1159">valeur du composant change</strong>, elle est =
refl=C3=A9t=C3=A9e dans le DOM.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1192" data-end=3D"1308" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1194" data-end=3D"1308" class=3D"">Si la <strong data-star=
t=3D"1200" data-end=3D"1224">valeur du DOM change</strong> (ex: saisie util=
isateur), elle met automatiquement =C3=A0 jour la variable du composant.</p=
>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1310" data-end=3D"1413" class=3D"">=E2=9E=A1=EF=B8=8F Cela=
 permet de <strong data-start=3D"1328" data-end=3D"1356">synchroniser les d=
onn=C3=A9es</strong> dans les deux sens sans gestion manuelle des =C3=A9v=
=C3=A9nements.</p>
