les <strong data-start=3D"7381" data-end=3D"7422">concepts fondamentaux du =
data binding</strong> et des <strong data-start=3D"7430" data-end=3D"7451">=
templates Angular</strong>.</p>
<p data-start=3D"7454" data-end=3D"7604" class=3D"">Souhaitez-vous maintena=
