<hr data-start=3D"736" data-end=3D"739" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"741" data-end=3D"791" class=3D"">=F0=9F=A7=A0 1. Qu=E2=80=
=99est-ce qu=E2=80=99une directive structurelle ?</h2>
<p data-start=3D"793" data-end=3D"988" class=3D"">Une <strong data-start=3D=
"797" data-end=3D"823">directive structurelle</strong> est une directive An=
gular qui <strong data-start=3D"854" data-end=3D"885">modifie la structure =
du DOM</strong>, c=E2=80=99est-=C3=A0-dire <strong data-start=3D"900" data-=
end=3D"950">ajoute, retire ou r=C3=A9organise des =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments HTML</=
strong> =C3=A0 partir de conditions ou de boucles.</p>
