art=3D"960" data-end=3D"968">*ngFor</code>) qui <strong data-start=3D"974" =
data-end=3D"998">ajoutent ou retirent</strong> des =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments du DO=
M, une directive <strong data-start=3D"1034" data-end=3D"1048">d=E2=80=99at=
tribut</strong> <strong data-start=3D"1049" data-end=3D"1113">modifie l'app=
arence ou le comportement d=E2=80=99un =C3=A9l=C3=A9ment existant</strong>.=
</p>
<p data-start=3D"1116" data-end=3D"1165" class=3D"">=F0=9F=93=8C Les direct=
ives d=E2=80=99attribut les plus utilis=C3=A9es :</p>
