<hr data-start=3D"5818" data-end=3D"5821" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"5823" data-end=3D"5838" class=3D"">=F0=9F=A7=BE 9. R=C3=
=A9sum=C3=A9</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"5840" data-end=3D"6338">
<li data-start=3D"5840" data-end=3D"5946" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5842" data-end=3D"5946" class=3D"">Les <strong data-start=
=3D"5846" data-end=3D"5855">pipes</strong> permettent de transformer les do=
nn=C3=A9es dans les templates sans toucher aux donn=C3=A9es sources.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5947" data-end=3D"6058" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5949" data-end=3D"6058" class=3D"">Angular fournit des <st=
rong data-start=3D"5969" data-end=3D"5997">pipes int=C3=A9gr=C3=A9s puissan=
ts</strong> pour les dates, les nombres, les cha=C3=AEnes, les monnaies, et=
c.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6059" data-end=3D"6147" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6061" data-end=3D"6147" class=3D"">Il est possible de <str=
ong data-start=3D"6080" data-end=3D"6121">cr=C3=A9er vos propres pipes pers=
onnalis=C3=A9s</strong>, avec ou sans param=C3=A8tres.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6148" data-end=3D"6240" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6150" data-end=3D"6240" class=3D"">La distinction entre <s=
trong data-start=3D"6171" data-end=3D"6183">pipe pur</strong> et <strong da=
ta-start=3D"6187" data-end=3D"6201">pipe impur</strong> est essentielle pou=
r les performances.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6241" data-end=3D"6338" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6243" data-end=3D"6338" class=3D"">Les pipes sont des <str=
ong data-start=3D"6262" data-end=3D"6294">outils puissants et lisibles</str=
ong> pour les transformations visuelles simples.</p>
</li>
</ul>
