 DI ?</h3>
<p data-start=3D"989" data-end=3D"1169" class=3D"">L=E2=80=99<strong data-s=
tart=3D"991" data-end=3D"1024">Injection de D=C3=A9pendances (DI)</strong> =
est un <strong data-start=3D"1032" data-end=3D"1056">mod=C3=A8le de concept=
ion</strong> (design pattern) o=C3=B9 les objets ne cr=C3=A9ent pas eux-m=
=C3=AAmes leurs d=C3=A9pendances, mais <strong data-start=3D"1136" data-end=
=3D"1168">les re=C3=A7oivent de l=E2=80=99ext=C3=A9rieur</strong>.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"1171" data-end=3D"1196" class=3D"">Pourquoi l=E2=80=99uti=
liser ?</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"1198" data-end=3D"1399">
<li data-start=3D"1198" data-end=3D"1242" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1200" data-end=3D"1242" class=3D"">Favorise la s=C3=A9para=
tion des responsabilit=C3=A9s</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1243" data-end=3D"1307" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1245" data-end=3D"1307" class=3D"">Rend les composants/tes=
t plus simples =C3=A0 maintenir et =C3=A0 =C3=A9tendre</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1308" data-end=3D"1338" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1310" data-end=3D"1338" class=3D"">Encourage la r=C3=A9uti=
lisabilit=C3=A9</p>
</li>
