<hr data-start=3D"3735" data-end=3D"3738" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"3740" data-end=3D"3774" class=3D"">6. =F0=9F=A7=AC Red=C3=
=A9claration de services</h2>
<p data-start=3D"3776" data-end=3D"3929" class=3D"">Si vous <strong data-st=
art=3D"3784" data-end=3D"3814">red=C3=A9clarez le m=C3=AAme service</strong=
> =C3=A0 plusieurs niveaux (racine, module, composant), Angular <strong dat=
a-start=3D"3872" data-end=3D"3900">cr=C3=A9e plusieurs instances</strong> s=
elon le niveau du provider.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"3931" data-end=3D"3944" class=3D"">Exemple :</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"3946" data-end=3D"4052">
<li data-start=3D"3946" data-end=3D"3993" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3948" data-end=3D"3993" class=3D"">Service <code data-star=
t=3D"3956" data-end=3D"3967">MyService</code> avec <code data-start=3D"3973=
" data-end=3D"3993">providedIn: 'root'</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3994" data-end=3D"4052" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3996" data-end=3D"4052" class=3D"">Composant <code data-st=
art=3D"4006" data-end=3D"4022">ChildComponent</code> avec <code data-start=
=3D"4028" data-end=3D"4052">providers: [MyService]</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"4054" data-end=3D"4176" class=3D"">=E2=9E=A1=EF=B8=8F Angu=
lar injectera une <strong data-start=3D"4079" data-end=3D"4107">nouvelle in=
stance locale</strong> dans <code data-start=3D"4113" data-end=3D"4129">Chi=
ldComponent</code>, qui ne sera <strong data-start=3D"4143" data-end=3D"415=
9">pas partag=C3=A9e</strong> avec les autres.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"4178" data-end=3D"4181" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"4183" data-end=3D"4227" class=3D"">7. =F0=9F=92=A4 Lazy l=
oading et instances multiples</h2>
<p data-start=3D"4229" data-end=3D"4327" class=3D"">Un module charg=C3=A9 d=
e mani=C3=A8re paresseuse (<code data-start=3D"4269" data-end=3D"4282">lazy=
-loaded</code>) a son <strong data-start=3D"4290" data-end=3D"4310">propre =
injecteur</strong>, ce qui permet :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4329" data-end=3D"4471">
<li data-start=3D"4329" data-end=3D"4392" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4331" data-end=3D"4392" class=3D"">D=E2=80=99avoir une <st=
rong data-start=3D"4343" data-end=3D"4364">nouvelle instance</strong> d=E2=
=80=99un service dans le module</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4393" data-end=3D"4471" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4395" data-end=3D"4471" class=3D"">D=E2=80=99=C3=A9viter q=
ue certains services soient partag=C3=A9s avec l=E2=80=99application princi=
pale</p>
</li>
</ul>
