<hr data-start=3D"5441" data-end=3D"5444" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"5446" data-end=3D"5471" class=3D"">11. =E2=9C=85 Bonnes p=
ratiques</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"5473" data-end=3D"5878">
<li data-start=3D"5473" data-end=3D"5560" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5475" data-end=3D"5560" class=3D"">Utiliser <code data-sta=
rt=3D"5484" data-end=3D"5496">routerLink</code> au lieu de <code data-start=
=3D"5508" data-end=3D"5521">&lt;a href=3D""&gt;</code> pour =C3=A9viter le =
rechargement de la page</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5561" data-end=3D"5630" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5563" data-end=3D"5630" class=3D"">Toujours utiliser <code=
 data-start=3D"5581" data-end=3D"5600">pathMatch: 'full'</code> dans les re=
directions de base</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5631" data-end=3D"5676" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5633" data-end=3D"5676" class=3D"">Pr=C3=A9voir une page 4=
04 avec wildcard (<code data-start=3D"5669" data-end=3D"5675">'**'</code>)<=
/p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5677" data-end=3D"5744" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5679" data-end=3D"5744" class=3D"">Modulariser les routes =
avec <code data-start=3D"5707" data-end=3D"5719">forChild()</code> dans les=
 modules enfants</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5745" data-end=3D"5797" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5747" data-end=3D"5797" class=3D"">=C3=89viter les param=
=C3=A8tres trop complexes dans les URLs</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5798" data-end=3D"5878" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5800" data-end=3D"5878" class=3D"">Toujours mettre <code d=
ata-start=3D"5816" data-end=3D"5830">RouterModule</code> dans <code data-st=
art=3D"5836" data-end=3D"5845">exports</code> si vous cr=C3=A9ez un <code d=
ata-start=3D"5863" data-end=3D"5878">RoutingModule</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"5880" data-end=3D"5883" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"5885" data-end=3D"5905" class=3D"">12. =F0=9F=A7=BE Concl=
usion</h2>
<p data-start=3D"5907" data-end=3D"6206" class=3D"">La navigation dans Angu=
lar est <strong data-start=3D"5938" data-end=3D"5951">puissante</strong>, <=
strong data-start=3D"5953" data-end=3D"5963">souple</strong>, et <strong da=
ta-start=3D"5968" data-end=3D"5983">essentielle</strong> pour toute applica=
tion SPA. Gr=C3=A2ce aux directives <code data-start=3D"6033" data-end=3D"6=
045">routerLink</code>, aux m=C3=A9thodes <code data-start=3D"6060" data-en=
d=3D"6072">navigate()</code> de <code data-start=3D"6076" data-end=3D"6084"=
>Router</code>, aux redirections, aux guards et =C3=A0 la gestion des param=
=C3=A8tres, Angular permet une navigation fluide, s=C3=A9curis=C3=A9e et lo=
gique.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"6208" data-end=3D"6211" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6213" data-end=3D"6263" class=3D"">Souhaitez-vous un exemp=
le de projet Angular avec :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6265" data-end=3D"6423" data-is-last-node=3D"" data-is-on=
ly-node=3D"">
<li data-start=3D"6265" data-end=3D"6295" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6267" data-end=3D"6295" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"626=
7" data-end=3D"6279">routerLink</code> et <code data-start=3D"6283" data-en=
d=3D"6295">navigate()</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6296" data-end=3D"6322" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6298" data-end=3D"6322" class=3D"">param=C3=A8tres, query =
params</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6323" data-end=3D"6342" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6325" data-end=3D"6342" class=3D"">guard de s=C3=A9curit=
=C3=A9</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6343" data-end=3D"6370" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6345" data-end=3D"6370" class=3D"">redirections automatiqu=
