<h2 data-start=3D"686" data-end=3D"730" class=3D"">1. =F0=9F=94=A2 Qu=E2=80=
=99est-ce qu=E2=80=99un intercepteur HTTP ?</h2>
<p data-start=3D"732" data-end=3D"934" class=3D"">Un intercepteur est une c=
lasse qui impl=C3=A9mente l=E2=80=99interface <code data-start=3D"790" data=
-end=3D"807">HttpInterceptor</code>. Il intercepte toutes les requ=C3=AAtes=
 sortantes (<code data-start=3D"854" data-end=3D"867">HttpRequest</code>) e=
t/ou les r=C3=A9ponses entrantes (<code data-start=3D"899" data-end=3D"913"=
>HttpResponse</code>) dans l=E2=80=99application.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"936" data-end=3D"957" class=3D"">Usages courants :</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"958" data-end=3D"1186">
<li data-start=3D"958" data-end=3D"984" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"960" data-end=3D"984" class=3D"">Ajouter un <strong data-s=
tart=3D"971" data-end=3D"984">token JWT</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"985" data-end=3D"1020" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"987" data-end=3D"1020" class=3D"">G=C3=A9rer <strong data-=
start=3D"993" data-end=3D"1020">les erreurs globalement</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1021" data-end=3D"1060" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1023" data-end=3D"1060" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
023" data-end=3D"1033">Logger</strong> les requ=C3=AAtes ou les dur=C3=A9es=
</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1061" data-end=3D"1105" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1063" data-end=3D"1105" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
063" data-end=3D"1086">Afficher un spinner</strong> pendant les appels</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1106" data-end=3D"1146" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1108" data-end=3D"1146" class=3D"">Impl=C3=A9menter <stron=
g data-start=3D"1120" data-end=3D"1146">des retry automatiques</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1147" data-end=3D"1186" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1149" data-end=3D"1186" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
149" data-end=3D"1172">Modifier la r=C3=A9ponse</strong> si n=C3=A9cessaire=
</p>
</li>
</ul>
