<hr data-start=3D"3566" data-end=3D"3569" class=3D"">
<h3 data-start=3D"3571" data-end=3D"3624" class=3D"">3. =F0=9F=94=84 Introd=
uction =C3=A0 l=E2=80=99architecture Flux et Redux</h3>
<p data-start=3D"3625" data-end=3D"3780" class=3D"">Les concepts d'<strong =
data-start=3D"3640" data-end=3D"3661">architecture Flux</strong> et de <str=
ong data-start=3D"3668" data-end=3D"3677">Redux</strong> permettent de g=C3=
=A9rer l=E2=80=99=C3=A9tat de mani=C3=A8re pr=C3=A9visible et unidirectionn=
elle. Voici les principaux concepts :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3782" data-end=3D"4057">
<li data-start=3D"3782" data-end=3D"3846" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3784" data-end=3D"3846" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
784" data-end=3D"3795">Actions</strong> : =C3=A9v=C3=A9nements qui d=C3=A9c=
lenchent un changement d=E2=80=99=C3=A9tat.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3847" data-end=3D"3947" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3849" data-end=3D"3947" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
849" data-end=3D"3861">Reducers</strong> : fonctions qui d=C3=A9crivent com=
ment l=E2=80=99=C3=A9tat doit =C3=AAtre mis =C3=A0 jour en r=C3=A9ponse aux=
 actions.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3948" data-end=3D"3995" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3950" data-end=3D"3995" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
950" data-end=3D"3959">Store</strong> : un objet contenant l=E2=80=99=C3=A9=
tat global.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3996" data-end=3D"4057" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3998" data-end=3D"4057" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
998" data-end=3D"4006">View</strong> : le composant qui affiche l'=C3=A9tat=
 =C3=A0 l'utilisateur.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"4059" data-end=3D"4204" class=3D"">Cela garantit que l=E2=
=80=99=C3=A9tat est toujours mis =C3=A0 jour de mani=C3=A8re coh=C3=A9rente=
, ce qui rend les applications plus faciles =C3=A0 tester, d=C3=A9boguer et=
 maintenir.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"4206" data-end=3D"4209" class=3D"">
<h3 data-start=3D"4211" data-end=3D"4277" class=3D"">4. =F0=9F=8F=97=EF=B8=
