<hr data-start=3D"2204" data-end=3D"2207" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"2209" data-end=3D"2265" class=3D"">2. =F0=9F=94=91 Pourqu=
oi Utiliser JWT pour l'Authentification ?</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"2267" data-end=3D"2287" class=3D"">Avantages de JWT</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"2288" data-end=3D"2845">
<li data-start=3D"2288" data-end=3D"2441" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2290" data-end=3D"2441" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
290" data-end=3D"2303">Stateless</strong> : Le serveur n'a pas besoin de st=
ocker l'=C3=A9tat de l'utilisateur entre les requ=C3=AAtes. Le jeton contie=
nt toutes les informations n=C3=A9cessaires.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2442" data-end=3D"2524" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2444" data-end=3D"2524" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
444" data-end=3D"2456">S=C3=A9curis=C3=A9</strong> : La signature permet de=
 garantir que le jeton n'a pas =C3=A9t=C3=A9 modifi=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2525" data-end=3D"2683" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2527" data-end=3D"2683" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
527" data-end=3D"2539">Evolutif</strong> : Les jetons peuvent =C3=AAtre uti=
lis=C3=A9s pour autoriser l'acc=C3=A8s =C3=A0 diff=C3=A9rents services sans=
 n=C3=A9cessiter une gestion complexe des sessions c=C3=B4t=C3=A9 serveur.<=
/p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2684" data-end=3D"2845" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2686" data-end=3D"2845" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
686" data-end=3D"2703">Transportable</strong> : Les jetons peuvent =C3=AAtr=
e envoy=C3=A9s dans les ent=C3=AAtes HTTP, et sont compatibles avec divers =
moyens de transport (ex. : cookies, stockage local).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"2847" data-end=3D"2850" class=3D"">
