<h2 data-start=3D"1104" data-end=3D"1163" class=3D"">1. =F0=9F=94=8D Pourqu=
oi utiliser le stockage local dans Angular ?</h2>
<p data-start=3D"1165" data-end=3D"1321" class=3D"">Dans une application fr=
ont-end comme Angular, <strong data-start=3D"1211" data-end=3D"1269">les se=
ssions utilisateur ne sont pas g=C3=A9r=C3=A9es nativement</strong> (comme =
dans PHP ou Laravel). Angular s'appuie sur :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1322" data-end=3D"1492">
<li data-start=3D"1322" data-end=3D"1365" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1324" data-end=3D"1365" class=3D"">Des <strong data-start=
=3D"1328" data-end=3D"1342">tokens JWT</strong> envoy=C3=A9s par le backend=
</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1366" data-end=3D"1427" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1368" data-end=3D"1427" class=3D"">Un <strong data-start=
=3D"1371" data-end=3D"1389">stockage local</strong> pour conserver ces toke=
ns c=C3=B4t=C3=A9 client</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1428" data-end=3D"1492" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1430" data-end=3D"1492" class=3D"">Un <strong data-start=
=3D"1433" data-end=3D"1454">intercepteur HTTP</strong> pour les r=C3=A9inje=
cter dans les requ=C3=AAtes</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1494" data-end=3D"1546" class=3D"">Utiliser <code data-sta=
rt=3D"1503" data-end=3D"1517">localStorage</code> ou <code data-start=3D"15=
21" data-end=3D"1537">sessionStorage</code> permet :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1547" data-end=3D"1724">
<li data-start=3D"1547" data-end=3D"1597" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1549" data-end=3D"1597" class=3D"">De conserver l=E2=80=99=
=C3=A9tat de connexion entre les pages</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1598" data-end=3D"1659" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1600" data-end=3D"1659" class=3D"">De rendre l=E2=80=99exp=
=C3=A9rience utilisateur fluide sans rechargement</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1660" data-end=3D"1724" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1662" data-end=3D"1724" class=3D"">De g=C3=A9rer des <stro=
ng data-start=3D"1675" data-end=3D"1707">donn=C3=A9es sensibles en m=C3=A9m=
oire</strong> (temporairement)</p>
