<hr data-start=3D"5995" data-end=3D"5998" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"6000" data-end=3D"6037" class=3D"">6. =F0=9F=A7=A0 Bonnes=
 pratiques de s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9</h2>
<p data-start=3D"6039" data-end=3D"6361" class=3D"">=E2=9C=85 Toujours chif=
frer les communications via HTTPS<br data-start=3D"6087" data-end=3D"6090">
=E2=9C=85 Valider les tokens c=C3=B4t=C3=A9 serveur =C3=A0 chaque requ=C3=
=AAte<br data-start=3D"6140" data-end=3D"6143">
=E2=9C=85 Ne stockez jamais de mots de passe, m=C3=AAme chiffr=C3=A9s, dans=
 le stockage local<br data-start=3D"6218" data-end=3D"6221">
=E2=9C=85 D=C3=A9connectez automatiquement l=E2=80=99utilisateur en cas d=
=E2=80=99inactivit=C3=A9 prolong=C3=A9e<br data-start=3D"6294" data-end=3D"=
6297">
=E2=9C=85 Nettoyez les donn=C3=A9es du stockage lors du logout (manuellemen=
t)</p>
<hr data-start=3D"6363" data-end=3D"6366" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"6368" data-end=3D"6423" class=3D"">7. =F0=9F=A7=AA Exempl=
e complet de gestion de session avec JWT</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"6425" data-end=3D"6435" class=3D"">Flux :</h3>
<ol data-start=3D"6436" data-end=3D"6754">
<li data-start=3D"6436" data-end=3D"6506" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6439" data-end=3D"6506" class=3D"">L=E2=80=99utilisateur s=
e connecte =E2=86=92 le backend retourne un <code data-start=3D"6490" data-=
end=3D"6497">token</code> + <code data-start=3D"6500" data-end=3D"6506">use=
r</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6507" data-end=3D"6561" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6510" data-end=3D"6561" class=3D"">Angular stocke <code da=
ta-start=3D"6525" data-end=3D"6532">token</code> + <code data-start=3D"6535=
" data-end=3D"6541">user</code> dans <code data-start=3D"6547" data-end=3D"=
6561">localStorage</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6562" data-end=3D"6637" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6565" data-end=3D"6637" class=3D"">=C3=80 chaque requ=C3=
=AAte, un intercepteur ajoute <code data-start=3D"6606" data-end=3D"6637">A=
uthorization: Bearer &lt;token&gt;</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6638" data-end=3D"6688" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6641" data-end=3D"6688" class=3D"">Le backend valide le to=
ken, renvoie les donn=C3=A9es</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6689" data-end=3D"6754" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6692" data-end=3D"6754" class=3D"">Si expiration =E2=86=92=
 suppression locale du token, redirection login</p>
</li>
</ol>
<blockquote data-start=3D"6756" data-end=3D"6886">
<p data-start=3D"6758" data-end=3D"6886" class=3D"">=F0=9F=94=90 Ce mod=C3=
=A8le fonctionne aussi avec des syst=C3=A8mes de refreshToken, pour garder =
une session active sans redemander le mot de passe.</p>
</blockquote>
<hr data-start=3D"6888" data-end=3D"6891" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"6893" data-end=3D"6908" class=3D"">=E2=9C=85 Conclusion</=
h2>
<p data-start=3D"6910" data-end=3D"7092" class=3D"">La gestion des sessions=
 via <code data-start=3D"6938" data-end=3D"6952">localStorage</code> ou <co=
de data-start=3D"6956" data-end=3D"6972">sessionStorage</code> est une <str=
ong data-start=3D"6981" data-end=3D"7007">composante essentielle</strong> d=
es applications Angular modernes. Bien que cela soit simple en apparence, i=
l faut :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"7093" data-end=3D"7279">
<li data-start=3D"7093" data-end=3D"7145" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7095" data-end=3D"7145" class=3D"">Bien choisir le mode de=
 stockage selon les besoins</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7146" data-end=3D"7187" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7148" data-end=3D"7187" class=3D"">V=C3=A9rifier et g=C3=
=A9rer l=E2=80=99expiration du token</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7188" data-end=3D"7239" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7190" data-end=3D"7239" class=3D"">S=C3=A9curiser l=E2=80=
=99acc=C3=A8s aux routes et donn=C3=A9es sensibles</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7240" data-end=3D"7279" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7242" data-end=3D"7279" class=3D"">Nettoyer le stockage =
=C3=A0 la d=C3=A9connexion</p>
</li>
</ul>
