<h2 data-start=3D"7180" data-end=3D"7238" class=3D"">6. =E2=9C=94=EF=B8=8F =
Bonnes pratiques des tests unitaires dans Angular</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"7240" data-end=3D"7565">
<li data-start=3D"7240" data-end=3D"7315" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7242" data-end=3D"7315" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
242" data-end=3D"7261">Test unitaire :</strong> Chaque test doit v=C3=A9rif=
ier une fonctionnalit=C3=A9 pr=C3=A9cise.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7316" data-end=3D"7393" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7318" data-end=3D"7393" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
318" data-end=3D"7343">Isolation des tests :</strong> Utilisez des mocks po=
ur les d=C3=A9pendances externes.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7394" data-end=3D"7489" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7396" data-end=3D"7489" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
396" data-end=3D"7418">Ex=C3=A9cution rapide :</strong> Les tests doivent =
=C3=AAtre rapides pour pouvoir =C3=AAtre ex=C3=A9cut=C3=A9s fr=C3=A9quemmen=
t.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7490" data-end=3D"7565" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7492" data-end=3D"7565" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
492" data-end=3D"7518">Simplicit=C3=A9 et clart=C3=A9 :</strong> R=C3=A9dig=
ez des tests lisibles et compr=C3=A9hensibles.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"7567" data-end=3D"7570" class=3D"">
