<p data-start=3D"7371" data-end=3D"7399" class=3D"">Les principales propri=
=C3=A9t=C3=A9s :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"7400" data-end=3D"7837">
<li data-start=3D"7400" data-end=3D"7444" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7402" data-end=3D"7444" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
402" data-end=3D"7412"><code data-start=3D"7404" data-end=3D"7410">name</co=
de></strong> : Nom complet de l=E2=80=99application.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7445" data-end=3D"7515" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7447" data-end=3D"7515" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
447" data-end=3D"7463"><code data-start=3D"7449" data-end=3D"7461">short_na=
me</code></strong> : Nom abr=C3=A9g=C3=A9 (utilis=C3=A9 lorsque l=E2=80=99e=
space est limit=C3=A9).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7516" data-end=3D"7599" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7518" data-end=3D"7599" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
518" data-end=3D"7533"><code data-start=3D"7520" data-end=3D"7531">start_ur=
l</code></strong> : URL de d=C3=A9part (g=C3=A9n=C3=A9ralement l=E2=80=99UR=
L principale de l=E2=80=99application).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7600" data-end=3D"7780" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7602" data-end=3D"7780" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
602" data-end=3D"7615"><code data-start=3D"7604" data-end=3D"7613">display<=
/code></strong> : Contr=C3=B4le l'affichage de l=E2=80=99application. <code=
 data-start=3D"7657" data-end=3D"7669">standalone</code> signifie que l'app=
lication est affich=C3=A9e comme une application native (sans barre de navi=
gation du navigateur).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7781" data-end=3D"7837" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7783" data-end=3D"7837" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
783" data-end=3D"7794"><code data-start=3D"7785" data-end=3D"7792">icons</c=
ode></strong> : Liste des ic=C3=B4nes de diff=C3=A9rentes tailles.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"7839" data-end=3D"7842" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"7844" data-end=3D"7889" class=3D"">6. =F0=9F=9A=80 Optimi=
ser les performances d'une PWA</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"7891" data-end=3D"7933" class=3D"">Mise en cache des ress=
ources critiques</h3>
<p data-start=3D"7935" data-end=3D"8125" class=3D"">Pour garantir une appli=
cation rapide et fiable, le service worker doit mettre en cache les ressour=
ces essentielles. Vous pouvez utiliser diff=C3=A9rentes strat=C3=A9gies de =
mise en cache, telles que :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"8127" data-end=3D"8306">
<li data-start=3D"8127" data-end=3D"8227" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8129" data-end=3D"8227" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"8=
129" data-end=3D"8143"><code data-start=3D"8131" data-end=3D"8141">prefetch=
</code></strong> : T=C3=A9l=C3=A9charge les ressources en avance pour qu'el=
les soient pr=C3=AAtes =C3=A0 =C3=AAtre utilis=C3=A9es.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8228" data-end=3D"8306" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8230" data-end=3D"8306" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"8=
230" data-end=3D"8240"><code data-start=3D"8232" data-end=3D"8238">lazy</co=
de></strong> : Charge les ressources uniquement lorsqu'elles sont n=C3=A9ce=
ssaires.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"8308" data-end=3D"8339" class=3D"">Minification et compre=
ssion</h3>
<p data-start=3D"8341" data-end=3D"8542" class=3D"">Lors de la construction=
 de votre application avec <code data-start=3D"8391" data-end=3D"8408">ng b=
uild --prod</code>, Angular va automatiquement minifier votre code et compr=
esser les fichiers JavaScript et CSS pour r=C3=A9duire la taille de l=E2=80=
=99application.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"8544" data-end=3D"8590" class=3D"">Utilisation des techni=
ques de lazy loading</h3>
<p data-start=3D"8592" data-end=3D"8784" class=3D"">Le lazy loading permet =
de charger les modules Angular de mani=C3=A8re paresseuse, ce qui am=C3=A9l=
iore les performances en chargeant uniquement les modules n=C3=A9cessaires =
lorsque l'utilisateur en a besoin.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"8786" data-end=3D"8789" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"8791" data-end=3D"8876" class=3D"">7. =F0=9F=94=94 Ajoute=
r des fonctionnalit=C3=A9s avanc=C3=A9es : Notifications Push et Background=
 Sync</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"8878" data-end=3D"8900" class=3D"">Notifications Push</h3=
>
<p data-start=3D"8902" data-end=3D"9005" class=3D"">Les PWAs peuvent envoye=
r des notifications push =C3=A0 l'utilisateur m=C3=AAme lorsqu'elles ne son=
t pas ouvertes.</p>
<ol data-start=3D"9007" data-end=3D"9067">
<li data-start=3D"9007" data-end=3D"9067" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"9010" data-end=3D"9067" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"9=
010" data-end=3D"9065">Demander l'autorisation pour les notifications push<=
/strong> :</p>
</li>
</ol>
<pre class=3D"overflow-visible!" data-start=3D"9069" data-end=3D"9217"><div=
 class=3D"contain-inline-size rounded-md border-[0.5px] border-token-border=
-medium relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class=3D"flex items=
-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-betwe=
