<h4 data-start=3D"4246" data-end=3D"4280" class=3D"">Explications des propr=
i=C3=A9t=C3=A9s :</h4>
<ul data-start=3D"4282" data-end=3D"4512">
<li data-start=3D"4282" data-end=3D"4416" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4284" data-end=3D"4416" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
284" data-end=3D"4311"><code data-start=3D"4286" data-end=3D"4309">installM=
ode: prefetch</code></strong> : Cela signifie que les fichiers sont imm=C3=
=A9diatement mis en cache d=C3=A8s que le service worker est install=C3=A9.=
</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4417" data-end=3D"4509" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4419" data-end=3D"4509" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
419" data-end=3D"4441"><code data-start=3D"4421" data-end=3D"4439">updateMo=
de: lazy</code></strong> : Les fichiers sont mis =C3=A0 jour uniquement lor=
squ'ils sont demand=C3=A9s.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"4513" data-end=3D"4553" class=3D"">Mise en cache des donn=
=C3=A9es dynamiques</h3>
<p data-start=3D"4555" data-end=3D"4736" class=3D"">Les <strong data-start=
=3D"4559" data-end=3D"4581">donn=C3=A9es dynamiques</strong> comme les API =
peuvent =C3=AAtre mises en cache =C3=A0 l=E2=80=99aide de strat=C3=A9gies t=
elles que <strong data-start=3D"4658" data-end=3D"4673">Cache-first</strong=
> ou <strong data-start=3D"4677" data-end=3D"4694">Network-first</strong> p=
our optimiser l=E2=80=99exp=C3=A9rience utilisateur :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4738" data-end=3D"5017">
<li data-start=3D"4738" data-end=3D"4882" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4740" data-end=3D"4882" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
740" data-end=3D"4755">Cache-first</strong> : Tente d=E2=80=99abord de char=
ger les donn=C3=A9es depuis le cache. Si les donn=C3=A9es ne sont pas pr=C3=
=A9sentes, la requ=C3=AAte r=C3=A9seau est effectu=C3=A9e.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4883" data-end=3D"5017" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4885" data-end=3D"5017" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
885" data-end=3D"4902">Network-first</strong> : Privil=C3=A9gie la r=C3=A9c=
up=C3=A9ration des donn=C3=A9es via le r=C3=A9seau, et en cas d=E2=80=99=C3=
=A9chec, une version mise en cache est utilis=C3=A9e.</p>
</li>
</ul>
