<h2 data-start=3D"8413" data-end=3D"8493" class=3D"">8. =F0=9F=A7=91=E2=80=
=8D=F0=9F=94=A7 Strat=C3=A9gies de Structuration pour des Applications Angu=
lar =C3=89volutives</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"8495" data-end=3D"8520" class=3D"">Organiser les Modules<=
/h3>
<p data-start=3D"8522" data-end=3D"8629" class=3D"">Une bonne organisation =
des modules est cruciale pour une application =C3=A9volutive. Voici quelque=
s strat=C3=A9gies :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"8631" data-end=3D"8950">
<li data-start=3D"8631" data-end=3D"8730" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8633" data-end=3D"8730" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"8=
633" data-end=3D"8652">Feature Modules</strong> : Chaque fonctionnalit=C3=
=A9 cl=C3=A9 de l'application devrait avoir son propre module.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8731" data-end=3D"8832" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8733" data-end=3D"8832" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"8=
733" data-end=3D"8750">Shared Module</strong> : Contient les composants r=
=C3=A9utilisables qui sont utilis=C3=A9s dans plusieurs modules.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8833" data-end=3D"8950" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8835" data-end=3D"8950" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"8=
835" data-end=3D"8850">Core Module</strong> : Contient les services et logi=
ques partag=C3=A9es (comme l=E2=80=99authentification et la gestion des err=
eurs).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"8952" data-end=3D"8976" class=3D"">Strat=C3=A9gie de nomm=
age</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"8978" data-end=3D"9231">
<li data-start=3D"8978" data-end=3D"9069" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8980" data-end=3D"9069" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"8=
980" data-end=3D"8999"><code data-start=3D"8982" data-end=3D"8997">app.modu=
le.ts</code></strong> : Module principal, souvent utilis=C3=A9 pour les con=
figurations globales.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"9070" data-end=3D"9147" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"9072" data-end=3D"9147" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"9=
072" data-end=3D"9095"><code data-start=3D"9074" data-end=3D"9093">feature.=
module.ts</code></strong> : Modules d=C3=A9di=C3=A9s =C3=A0 des fonctionnal=
it=C3=A9s sp=C3=A9cifiques.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"9148" data-end=3D"9231" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"9150" data-end=3D"9231" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"9=
150" data-end=3D"9172"><code data-start=3D"9152" data-end=3D"9170">shared.m=
odule.ts</code></strong> : Module regroupant les composants et directives p=
artag=C3=A9s.</p>
</li>
</ul>
