<ul data-start=3D"8605" data-end=3D"8793">
<li data-start=3D"8605" data-end=3D"8667" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8607" data-end=3D"8667" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"8=
607" data-end=3D"8623">Minification</strong> : R=C3=A9duit la taille des fi=
chiers JavaScript.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8668" data-end=3D"8715" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8670" data-end=3D"8715" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"8=
670" data-end=3D"8686">Tree Shaking</strong> : =C3=89limine le code inutili=
s=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8716" data-end=3D"8790" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8718" data-end=3D"8790" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"8=
718" data-end=3D"8734">Uglification</strong> : Renomme les variables pour r=
=C3=A9duire la taille du code.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"8794" data-end=3D"8893" class=3D"">Angular utilise Webpack=
 pour effectuer ces optimisations lorsque l'option <strong data-start=3D"88=
