I/CD dans le processus de d=C3=A9veloppement permet de :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2842" data-end=3D"3227">
<li data-start=3D"2842" data-end=3D"2911" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2844" data-end=3D"2911" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
844" data-end=3D"2859">Automatiser</strong> les =C3=A9tapes r=C3=A9p=C3=A9t=
itives (tests, build, d=C3=A9ploiement).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2912" data-end=3D"3007" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2914" data-end=3D"3007" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
914" data-end=3D"2946">R=C3=A9duire les erreurs humaines</strong> en =C3=A9=
liminant les =C3=A9tapes manuelles du processus de livraison.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3008" data-end=3D"3115" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3010" data-end=3D"3115" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
010" data-end=3D"3042">Am=C3=A9liorer la qualit=C3=A9 du code</strong> gr=
=C3=A2ce =C3=A0 des tests automatiques qui se d=C3=A9clenchent =C3=A0 chaqu=
e modification.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3116" data-end=3D"3227" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3118" data-end=3D"3227" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
118" data-end=3D"3155">Acc=C3=A9l=C3=A9rer les cycles de livraison</strong>=
, permettant une mise =C3=A0 jour plus rapide des applications en productio=
n.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"3229" data-end=3D"3286" class=3D"">Aper=C3=A7u des Outils=
 CI/CD : GitHub Actions et GitLab CI</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"3288" data-end=3D"3655">
<li data-start=3D"3288" data-end=3D"3493" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3290" data-end=3D"3493" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
290" data-end=3D"3308">GitHub Actions</strong> : Un service int=C3=A9gr=C3=
=A9 =C3=A0 GitHub qui permet d'automatiser des workflows dans vos d=C3=A9p=
=C3=B4ts. Il prend en charge des actions de build, test, et d=C3=A9ploiemen=
t via des fichiers YAML configurables.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3497" data-end=3D"3655" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3499" data-end=3D"3655" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
499" data-end=3D"3512">GitLab CI</strong> : Un outil de CI/CD int=C3=A9gr=
=C3=A9 =C3=A0 GitLab qui vous permet de configurer des pipelines pour teste=
r, valider et d=C3=A9ployer automatiquement vos projets.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"3657" data-end=3D"3660" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"3662" data-end=3D"3714" class=3D"">2. =E2=9A=99=EF=B8=8F =
