=99Application Angular pour l=E2=80=99Int=C3=A9gration</h3>
<p data-start=3D"3771" data-end=3D"3912" class=3D"">Avant de configurer vos=
 pipelines CI/CD, vous devez vous assurer que votre application Angular est=
 pr=C3=AAte pour l=E2=80=99automatisation. Cela inclut :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3913" data-end=3D"4154">
<li data-start=3D"3913" data-end=3D"3954" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3915" data-end=3D"3954" class=3D"">Avoir une <strong data-=
start=3D"3925" data-end=3D"3943">version stable</strong> du projet.</p>
