<li data-start=3D"3955" data-end=3D"4025" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3957" data-end=3D"4025" class=3D"">Cr=C3=A9er un <strong d=
ata-start=3D"3966" data-end=3D"3989">build de production</strong> avec la c=
ommande <code data-start=3D"4007" data-end=3D"4024">ng build --prod</code>.=
