<p data-start=3D"5522" data-end=3D"5641" class=3D"">=E2=9A=99=EF=B8=8F <str=
ong data-start=3D"5525" data-end=3D"5546">ESLint + Prettier</strong> assure=
nt ensemble le <strong data-start=3D"5568" data-end=3D"5588">respect du sty=
le</strong> (ESLint) et la <strong data-start=3D"5604" data-end=3D"5629">mi=
se en forme du code</strong> (Prettier).</p>
</blockquote>
<hr data-start=3D"5643" data-end=3D"5646" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"5648" data-end=3D"5733" class=3D"">7. =F0=9F=A7=A0 Normes=
 avanc=C3=A9es de qualit=C3=A9 de code (Clean Code, SOLID, Architecture Ang=
ular)</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"5735" data-end=3D"5752" class=3D"">=F0=9F=A7=BC Clean Cod=
e</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"5754" data-end=3D"5937">
<li data-start=3D"5754" data-end=3D"5817" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5756" data-end=3D"5817" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
756" data-end=3D"5775">Noms explicites</strong> : <code data-start=3D"5778"=
 data-end=3D"5794">getUserToken()</code> au lieu de <code data-start=3D"580=
6" data-end=3D"5817">getData()</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5818" data-end=3D"5855" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5820" data-end=3D"5855" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
820" data-end=3D"5841">Fonctions courtes</strong> : &lt; 20 lignes</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5856" data-end=3D"5937" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5858" data-end=3D"5937" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
858" data-end=3D"5883">Responsabilit=C3=A9 unique</strong> : chaque fichier=
 / classe doit faire une seule chose.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"5939" data-end=3D"5970" class=3D"">=F0=9F=A7=B1 SOLID app=
liqu=C3=A9 =C3=A0 Angular</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"5972" data-end=3D"6354">
<li data-start=3D"5972" data-end=3D"6043" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5974" data-end=3D"6043" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
974" data-end=3D"5979">S</strong> (Single Responsibility) =E2=86=92 un serv=
ice ne doit faire qu'une chose</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6044" data-end=3D"6118" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6046" data-end=3D"6118" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
046" data-end=3D"6051">O</strong> (Open/Closed) =E2=86=92 utilisez les inte=
rfaces, pas les classes concr=C3=A8tes</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6119" data-end=3D"6205" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6121" data-end=3D"6205" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
121" data-end=3D"6126">L</strong> (Liskov) =E2=86=92 chaque sous-composant =
doit pouvoir remplacer son parent sans erreur</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6206" data-end=3D"6275" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6208" data-end=3D"6275" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
208" data-end=3D"6213">I</strong> (Interface Segregation) =E2=86=92 s=C3=A9=
parer les interfaces trop lourdes</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6276" data-end=3D"6354" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6278" data-end=3D"6354" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
278" data-end=3D"6283">D</strong> (Dependency Inversion) =E2=86=92 utilisez=
 <code data-start=3D"6318" data-end=3D"6331">@Injectable</code> et l=E2=80=
=99injection Angular</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"6356" data-end=3D"6394" class=3D"">=F0=9F=8F=97=EF=B8=8F =
Architecture modulaire Angular</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"6396" data-end=3D"6532">
<li data-start=3D"6396" data-end=3D"6426" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6398" data-end=3D"6426" class=3D"">Organisation par <stron=
g data-start=3D"6415" data-end=3D"6426">feature</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6427" data-end=3D"6469" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6429" data-end=3D"6469" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
429" data-end=3D"6445">Lazy loading</strong> pour les modules lourds</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6470" data-end=3D"6532" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6472" data-end=3D"6532" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
472" data-end=3D"6480">NgRx</strong> ou <strong data-start=3D"6484" data-en=
d=3D"6496">services</strong> bien s=C3=A9par=C3=A9s pour la logique m=C3=A9=
tier</p>
</li>
</ul>
