<hr data-start=3D"5121" data-end=3D"5124" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"5126" data-end=3D"5200" class=3D"">7. =F0=9F=A7=A0 Princi=
pes SOLID et s=C3=A9paration des responsabilit=C3=A9s (niveau expert)</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"5202" data-end=3D"5231" class=3D"">S =E2=80=94 Single Res=
ponsibility</h3>
<p data-start=3D"5232" data-end=3D"5295" class=3D"">Chaque composant/servic=
e/module doit faire <strong data-start=3D"5275" data-end=3D"5294">une seule=
 chose</strong>.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"5297" data-end=3D"5316" class=3D"">O =E2=80=94 Open/Close=
d</h3>
<p data-start=3D"5317" data-end=3D"5410" class=3D"">Les entit=C3=A9s doiven=
t =C3=AAtre ouvertes =C3=A0 l=E2=80=99extension, ferm=C3=A9es =C3=A0 la mod=
ification (via l=E2=80=99injection).</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"5412" data-end=3D"5439" class=3D"">L =E2=80=94 Liskov Sub=
stitution</h3>
<p data-start=3D"5440" data-end=3D"5514" class=3D"">Un composant enfant doi=
t pouvoir remplacer son parent sans effets de bord.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"5516" data-end=3D"5545" class=3D"">I =E2=80=94 Interface =
Segregation</h3>
<p data-start=3D"5546" data-end=3D"5620" class=3D"">Cr=C3=A9er plusieurs pe=
tites interfaces sp=C3=A9cifiques au lieu d=E2=80=99une seule grosse.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"5622" data-end=3D"5650" class=3D"">D =E2=80=94 Dependency=
 Inversion</h3>
<p data-start=3D"5651" data-end=3D"5742" class=3D"">Utiliser l'injection de=
 d=C3=A9pendances (Angular le fait naturellement avec les <code data-start=
=3D"5727" data-end=3D"5740">@Injectable</code>).</p>
<hr data-start=3D"5744" data-end=3D"5747" class=3D"">
