<hr data-start=3D"6483" data-end=3D"6486" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"6488" data-end=3D"6541" class=3D"">9. =F0=9F=A7=AA Tests =
et maintenance dans un projet scalable</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"6543" data-end=3D"6800">
<li data-start=3D"6543" data-end=3D"6648" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6545" data-end=3D"6648" class=3D"">Les <strong data-start=
=3D"6549" data-end=3D"6568">tests unitaires</strong> doivent viser les serv=
ices/facades (pas la logique m=C3=A9tier dans les composants).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6649" data-end=3D"6739" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6651" data-end=3D"6739" class=3D"">Les composants doivent =
=C3=AAtre <strong data-start=3D"6679" data-end=3D"6687">dumb</strong> : seu=
lement de l=E2=80=99affichage + =C3=A9mission d=E2=80=99=C3=A9v=C3=A9nement=
s.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6740" data-end=3D"6800" class=3D"">
