<h2 data-start=3D"1694" data-end=3D"1744" class=3D"">1. =F0=9F=8E=AF Pourqu=
oi animer une application Angular ?</h2>
<p data-start=3D"1746" data-end=3D"1818" class=3D"">Les animations enrichis=
sent l'exp=C3=A9rience utilisateur (UX) en apportant :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1819" data-end=3D"2121">
<li data-start=3D"1819" data-end=3D"1888" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1821" data-end=3D"1888" class=3D"">Du <strong data-start=
=3D"1824" data-end=3D"1843">feedback visuel</strong> (saisie de formulaire,=
 validation, erreurs).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1889" data-end=3D"1965" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1891" data-end=3D"1965" class=3D"">Une <strong data-start=
=3D"1895" data-end=3D"1939">meilleure compr=C3=A9hension de la navigation</=
strong> (transitions entre vues).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1966" data-end=3D"2028" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1968" data-end=3D"2028" class=3D"">Une <strong data-start=
=3D"1972" data-end=3D"2004">am=C3=A9lioration de l'esth=C3=A9tique</strong>=
 et du <strong data-start=3D"2011" data-end=3D"2027">design per=C3=A7u</str=
ong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2029" data-end=3D"2121" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2031" data-end=3D"2121" class=3D"">Une <strong data-start=
=3D"2035" data-end=3D"2078">structuration visuelle de l'information</strong=
> (apparition progressive, hi=C3=A9rarchisation).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<blockquote data-start=3D"2123" data-end=3D"2204">
<p data-start=3D"2125" data-end=3D"2204" class=3D"">=E2=9A=A0=EF=B8=8F Atte=
ntion : trop d=E2=80=99animations =3D surcharge cognitive + baisse de perfo=
rmance.</p>
</blockquote>
