code data-start=3D"2416" data-end=3D"2423">*ngIf</code>, <code data-start=
=3D"2425" data-end=3D"2433">*ngFor</code>, routing, etc.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2449" data-end=3D"2501" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2451" data-end=3D"2501" class=3D"">=C3=89v=C3=A9nements et=
 hooks (<code data-start=3D"2472" data-end=3D"2484">@.disabled</code>, <cod=
e data-start=3D"2486" data-end=3D"2493">@done</code>, etc.).</p>
